                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Except as provided in Section 16F, it is agreed that application of Section 16 shall be limited to the facility where the Employee is employed and shall not be inter-facility. Employees shall have no right to exercise their Section 16 rights between the facilities for any purpose.",
